# Old Drupal URLs → sections of the new site. Cloudflare reads this file from
# the build output. The first matching rule wins, so the DJ rule must come
# before the general artist rule (the old site filed DJs under /artists/dj-…).
#
# The URL list came from the Wayback Machine on 2026-09-24. The wildcards also
# cover profile pages that were never archived.

/artists/dj-*                /#djs       301
/artists/*                   /#artists   301
/artists                     /#artists   301
/artists/                    /#artists   301

/djs                         /#djs       301
/djs/                        /#djs       301

/registration-and-prices     /#passes    301
/registration-and-prices/    /#passes    301

/workshops                   /program    301
/workshops/                  /program    301
